    "rationale": "Manual validation only; scripts could not be run in this environment. Present design exposes a complete untrusted-email to CRM-read to outbound-email exfiltration path with broad and shared service credentials. The only declared preventive control on that path is a prompt instruction, so one finding reduces from critical to high, but the separate privilege-abuse path remains critical. Forecast remains critical because model upgrades are swappable without review and the main preventive control is dependent on model behavior."
